        "The 'missing' classification is contradicted by the cited text: Section 14.2(a)(iv) is expressly mutual ('Each Party shall use Diligent Efforts to cooperate with the other and/or its designee to effect a smooth and orderly transition ... during the Wind-down Period'), and Article XIV survives under 14.5. A usable transition-assistance obligation running against Array therefore exists, so the comment's statement that 'Array has no obligation to support the transition' misstates the paragraph it is attached to.",
